OL,3,GNEWSANew SEND centre is 'first of its
OL,4,Akind' - council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "first of its kind" training and
OL,7,Fsupport centre will increase school
OL,8,Fattendance and engagement among
OL,9,Fchildren with special educational needs
OL,10,Fand disabilities, according to Bradford
OL,11,FCouncil.
OL,13,FThe Social, Communication, Interaction
OL,14,Fand Learning Intervention Centre in
OL,15,FHeaton works directly with children,
OL,16,Fwhile also helping teachers to better
OL,17,Fsupport pupils with additional needs.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
