OL,3,GNEWSANew SEND centre is 'first of its
OL,4,Akind' - council
OL,5,
OL,6,FBased on a similar scheme in
OL,7,FWorcestershire, the facility has been
OL,8,Fdeveloped with the support of Bradford
OL,9,Fheadteachers and is based at Margaret
OL,10,FMcMillan Primary School.
OL,12,FSally Birch, executive member for
OL,13,Fchildren and families, said it would
OL,14,Fhelp schools get the "expertise they
OL,15,Fneed to support pupils more
OL,16,Feffectively".
